course: dictionary
lesson: 442
title: A word for a group of islands
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Some words name a whole group of things, not just one thing. An archipelago is a group of islands close together in the sea. Japan, Indonesia and the Philippines are all archipelagos, and each one is made of many islands.
explain: Look at the context: «Turtle, South, Borneo, Celebes, Sumatra, Java and the Malay Archipelago.» The sentence lists several islands, then names the Malay Archipelago. Ask yourself what would fit: a group of islands fits, but one single island does not.
explain: The word sounds grand, but its meaning is simple. Another way to say it is «a chain of islands». To check your meaning, swap the phrase into the sentence: if it still makes sense, you have found the right meaning.
fact: An archipelago is a group of islands close together in the sea.
fact: Japan, Indonesia, the Philippines, the Hebrides and the Galápagos are all archipelagos.
fact: Another way to say archipelago is «a chain of islands».
fact: The plural can be written as archipelagos or archipelagoes.
fact: Look for the clue «close together»: the islands sit near each other, not spread far apart.
exercise: Read «...the Malay Archipelago.» What is an archipelago? | A single very large island | *A group of islands close together in the sea | A deep lake in the mountains | A river that runs into the sea
exercise: Which of these is an archipelago? | *Indonesia | The Indian Desert | The Everglades | The Himalayan Mountains
exercise: Which phrase means the same as archipelago? | *a chain of islands | a row of houses | a chain of mountains | a line of trees
test: Why must archipelago mean a group of islands in «Borneo, Celebes, Sumatra, Java and the Malay Archipelago»? | Because it is a type of weather | Because it is a sea animal | *Because the sentence lists islands and archipelago comes at the end of that list | Because it is a kind of boat
test: Jayden reads that the Galápagos is an archipelago. What does this tell him? | It is one huge island | *It is a group of islands close together | It is a river in the desert | It is a high mountain range
exam: Jayden reads that Japan is an archipelago. Which best describes Japan? | *A group of islands in the sea | A tall mountain range | A deep valley with a river | A hot desert
